// The tailnet's OWN policy rules, kept as they are; policy.tf merges the lab additions into them
// (tags, grants, autoApprovers, ssh, nodeAttrs, tests). See README.md, "Base policy".
//
// Format: JSON plus full-line // comments (stripped before parsing). No trailing commas, no
// comments at the end of a line. Logins/emails are NOT written here (public repo): use
// $${id.<name>} and put the value in var.policy_identities (1Password field policy_identities).
//
// PLACEHOLDER: replace this whole object with the tailnet's current policy before the first
// apply. The __replace_with_current_policy key makes the plan fail until then, so the
// tailnet's existing rules can never be overwritten by this stub.
{
  "__replace_with_current_policy": true
}
